<title>TAIWAN: Taiwan stock market closes for public holiday.</title>
<headline>Taiwan stock market closes for public holiday.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-11-12</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Taiwan stock market is closed on Tuesday for a domestic public holiday.</p>
<p>On Monday, the weighted index ended down 11.96 points or 0.18 percent at 6,571.12. Turnover was T$36.03 billion.</p>
<p>The market will reopen on Wednesday.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
